        "raw": "<p>My money is on Fright Train during the attack on Freedom Tower.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It makes sense. Considering her death was in Freedom Tower while the heroes were otherwise occupied saving &quot;strangers&quot;. Probably Baron Blade causing havok and keeping their attention harming civilians. In the Freedom Tower card &quot;Entry Point&quot; Fright Train is smashing through a flat wall that kinda resembles the Miss Information card room (if the power was out and there was a tone change).</p><p>I could believe that Fright Train burst through the wall during the (lo)commotion (heh, puns) and either intentionally or unintentionally knocks Aminia Twain off the building to her death. The effects of Time Cataclysm still prevelant and Tachyon&#39;s research lab spewing all kinds of Multiverse research everywhere fused the two timeline versions of her.</p><p>With Freedom Tower and the timing of the attack, Miss Information was born from <em>Vengeance</em>. And that is what she now seeks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Just an idea.</p>",
